# Solana RPC endpoint used by `pnpm spike` and `pnpm harvest`.
# Unset = the public mainnet endpoint (rate-limited, fine for the spike).
# For older/pruned transactions use an archival endpoint — Helius / Triton /
# QuickNode free tiers work.
#
# If your URL embeds an API key, it is a SECRET: keep it in .env (gitignored),
# never in code, fixtures, or committed config.
RPC_URL=https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com
